// BubbleTea (Charm TUI) platform package.
//
// Components render through four inlined blueprint primitives — Layout,
// Styled, Widget and Overlay — whose props are the blueprint records in bubbletea.sngl
// (JoinDir, Model, Focus, Bind, Event). The Go extractor in blueprint.go reads
// these off the inlined NodeInst; see view_ir.go / compiler_ir.go for how each
// primitive lowers to lipgloss / bubbles model code.
